    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're trying to help but it just feels so illogical. if someone is stuck in a hole and they're constantly pulling everyone else down with them, wouldn't the most selfless thing to do be to just... stop being the problem? if i wasn't here, they could actually move on and live their lives without this constant shadow over them. wouldn't that be a better gift to them than me just \"trying\" to get better?",
